{
	quest.03F0499109433E1B.quest_desc: [
		"Stack modules on the refinery for more outputs."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Refinery Chamber Module and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
